Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.46,0:22:41.42,Ending-Magia-English,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\be4\fad(200,320)}One day the light of love burning in your eyes
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.42,0:22:43.34,Ending-Magia-English,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\be4\fad(0,320)}will transcend time
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.34,0:22:47.41,Ending-Magia-English,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\be4\fad(0,320)}and destroy one of this world's dreams
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.41,0:22:51.05,Ending-Magia-English,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\be4\fad(0,320)}as it spirals toward the apocalypse
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.05,0:22:53.90,Ending-Magia-English,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\be4\fad(0,320)}What is it that you seek
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.90,0:22:57.47,Ending-Magia-English,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\be4\fad(0,320)}now that you're done hesitating?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.47,0:23:02.53,Ending-Magia-English,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\be4\fad(0,320)}Is there a glimpse of hope for tomorrow
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.53,0:23:06.97,Ending-Magia-English,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\be4\fad(0,620)}beyond this greedy admiration?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.09,0:23:12.18,Ending-Magia-English,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\be4\fad(200,320)}I want to be armed with the power
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.18,0:23:15.99,Ending-Magia-English,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\be4\fad(0,320)}to shatter even the darkness in my hand,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.99,0:23:19.83,Ending-Magia-English,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\be4\fad(0,320)}just like the ancient magic in my childhood dreams,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.83,0:23:23.71,Ending-Magia-English,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\be4\fad(0,320)}the next time I see your innocent smile.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.71,0:23:27.50,Ending-Magia-English,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\be4\fad(0,320)}In my trembling hands I hold
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.50,0:23:31.33,Ending-Magia-English,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\be4\fad(0,320)}the courage of a plucked flower
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.33,0:23:35.17,Ending-Magia-English,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\be4\fad(0,320)}My feelings are all I can rely on;
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.17,0:23:39.04,Ending-Magia-English,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\be4\fad(0,320)}the prayer that awakens
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.04,0:23:46.74,Ending-Magia-English,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\be4\fad(0,1620)}the light
Dialogue: 5,0:00:19.79,0:00:20.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 5,0:00:25.76,0:00:27.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 5,0:00:31.39,0:00:33.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks for all you've done.
Dialogue: 5,0:00:33.67,0:00:37.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a genius when it comes to finding rare CDs.
Dialogue: 5,0:00:37.88,0:00:40.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm probably just lucky is all.
Dialogue: 5,0:00:40.84,0:00:43.80,Default,,0,0,0,,This artist's performances really are incredible.
Dialogue: 5,0:00:43.80,0:00:45.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you want to listen too, Sayaka?
Dialogue: 5,0:00:46.17,0:00:47.72,Default,,0,0,0,,A-Are you sure?
Dialogue: 5,0:00:48.93,0:00:52.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd really like to have you hear it from the speakers, but we're in a hospital, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.98,0:01:27.03,Default,chptr,0,0,0,,{OP}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.03,0:02:57.07,Default,chptr,0,0,0,,{Episode}
Dialogue: 5,0:03:02.78,0:03:04.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Tiro Finale!{\i0}
Dialogue: 5,0:03:15.24,0:03:18.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Man, you're so cool, Mami{*}-san{*}.
Dialogue: 5,0:03:18.56,0:03:21.26,Default,,0,0,0,,This isn't a magic show, you know.
Dialogue: 5,0:03:22.52,0:03:26.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't forget that what\Nwe're doing is dangerous.
Dialogue: 5,0:03:26.18,0:03:27.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 5,0:03:29.44,0:03:32.12,Default,,0,0,0,,It didn't drop a Grief Seed.
Dialogue: 5,0:03:32.12,0:03:35.83,Default,,0,0,0,,That's because it was just a \Nfamiliar that split off from a witch.
Dialogue: 5,0:03:35.83,0:03:37.84,Default,,0,0,0,,They don't carry Grief Seeds.
Dialogue: 5,0:03:37.84,0:03:39.61,Default,,0,0,0,,So it wasn't a witch.
Dialogue: 5,0:03:39.61,0:03:42.59,Default,,0,0,0,,We've been fighting nothing but duds lately.
Dialogue: 5,0:03:42.59,0:03:45.04,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't ignore the familiars, though.
Dialogue: 5,0:03:45.04,0:03:49.05,Default,,0,0,0,,If allowed to develop, familiars become the same kind of witch they broke off from.
Dialogue: 5,0:03:50.03,0:03:51.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, let's go.
Dialogue: 5,0:03:53.17,0:03:55.64,Default,,0,0,0,,So have you figured out\N what you want to wish for?
Dialogue: 5,0:03:56.90,0:03:58.20,Default,,0,0,0,,What about you, Madoka?
Dialogue: 5,0:03:59.42,0:04:03.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I guess it's hard to think of\N something when you're on the spot.
Dialogue: 5,0:04:04.06,0:04:06.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Mami{*}-san{*}, what did you wish for?
Dialogue: 5,0:04:07.79,0:04:11.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, uh... You don't really have to tell me!
Dialogue: 5,0:04:13.49,0:04:14.95,Default,,0,0,0,,In my case...
Dialogue: 5,0:04:25.90,0:04:28.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,768)}I didn't have time to think about it.
Dialogue: 5,0:04:30.78,0:04:33.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't really regret it.
Dialogue: 5,0:04:33.14,0:04:38.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I think my current way of life is much better than having died back there.
Dialogue: 5,0:04:38.76,0:04:44.80,Default,,0,0,0,,But you know, if you have the choice you should think it through.
Dialogue: 5,0:04:45.40,0:04:48.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I want you to have the opportunity I didn't get.
Dialogue: 5,0:04:48.95,0:04:55.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Mami{*}-san{*}, does your \Nwish have to be for yourself?
Dialogue: 5,0:04:55.26,0:04:55.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 5,0:04:55.70,0:04:59.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Like hypothetically... Hypothetically, all right?
Dialogue: 5,0:04:59.71,0:05:03.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Say there was someone\N who was worse off than me.
Dialogue: 5,0:05:03.04,0:05:05.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Could I use my wish for them?
Dialogue: 5,0:05:05.33,0:05:07.33,Default,,0,0,0,,You mean Kamijou{*}-kun{*}?
Dialogue: 5,0:05:07.33,0:05:10.24,Default,,0,0,0,,D-Didn't I say hypothetically?! Gosh!
Dialogue: 5,0:05:10.24,0:05:15.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoever makes the contract doesn't\Nnecessarily need to be the target for the wish.
Dialogue: 5,0:05:15.71,0:05:17.84,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not like it hasn't happened before, either.
Dialogue: 5,0:05:17.84,0:05:20.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't say I like the idea, though.
Dialogue: 5,0:05:21.74,0:05:24.02,Default,,0,0,0,,If you're going to grant\N a wish for someone else,
Dialogue: 5,0:05:24.02,0:05:27.35,Default,,0,0,0,,then it's vital that you know what it is you're wishing for.
Dialogue: 5,0:05:27.35,0:05:31.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Miki{*}-san{*}, do you want his wish to come true,
Dialogue: 5,0:05:31.11,0:05:34.86,Default,,0,0,0,,or do you want to be the person who made his wish come true?
Dialogue: 5,0:05:34.86,0:05:36.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Mami{*}-san{*}...
Dialogue: 5,0:05:36.12,0:05:39.36,Default,,0,0,0,,They might sound the same, \Nbut they're completely different.
Dialogue: 5,0:05:39.36,0:05:43.12,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a harsh way of putting it.
Dialogue: 5,0:05:43.12,0:05:46.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, but it has to be said now.
Dialogue: 5,0:05:47.39,0:05:52.13,Default,,0,0,0,,If you went ahead without realizing that, \NI'm sure you'd regret it later.
Dialogue: 5,0:05:57.17,0:05:58.57,Default,,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 5,0:05:58.94,0:06:01.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I was being a little too naïve.
Dialogue: 5,0:06:01.23,0:06:02.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry about that.
Dialogue: 5,0:06:02.14,0:06:06.12,Default,,0,0,0,,This is pretty difficult to deal with, isn't it?
Dialogue: 5,0:06:06.76,0:06:08.93,Default,,0,0,0,,You shouldn't rush your decision.
Dialogue: 5,0:06:09.39,0:06:12.81,Default,,0,0,0,,The sooner the better for me, though.
Dialogue: 5,0:06:12.81,0:06:14.05,Default,,0,0,0,,That won't do.
Dialogue: 5,0:06:14.05,0:06:16.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Girls hate guys who pressure them.
Dialogue: 5,0:06:22.32,0:06:25.58,Default,,0,0,0,,It really isn't that simple, is it?
Dialogue: 5,0:06:25.58,0:06:28.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not in a position to pressure you into it.
Dialogue: 5,0:06:28.25,0:06:30.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Suggestions are against the rules too.
Dialogue: 5,0:06:31.27,0:06:35.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess just wishing to become a magical girl wouldn't work, huh?
Dialogue: 5,0:06:35.00,0:06:38.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Madoka, do you just thirst for power?
Dialogue: 5,0:06:38.51,0:06:40.89,Default,,0,0,0,,No, that's not what I mean...
Dialogue: 5,0:06:42.95,0:06:44.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Or maybe I do...
Dialogue: 5,0:06:44.68,0:06:48.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, I'm slow, and I'm not good at anything.
Dialogue: 5,0:06:48.39,0:06:52.70,Default,,0,0,0,,So if I could be someone cool and wonderful like Mami{*}-san{*},
Dialogue: 5,0:06:52.70,0:06:55.33,Default,,0,0,0,,then that in itself would be\N enough to make me happy.
Dialogue: 5,0:06:55.33,0:06:59.53,Default,,0,0,0,,You could become a much more \Npowerful magical girl than Mami.
Dialogue: 5,0:06:59.53,0:07:00.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 5,0:07:00.92,0:07:05.01,Default,,0,0,0,,The sort of wish you make\N factors into it as well,
Dialogue: 5,0:07:05.01,0:07:10.04,Default,,0,0,0,,but even I can't even imagine how large a Soul Gem you might produce.
Dialogue: 5,0:07:10.04,0:07:13.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I've never met a girl with such potential before.
Dialogue: 5,0:07:15.30,0:07:17.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 5,0:07:17.21,0:07:18.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You're joking, right?
Dialogue: 5,0:07:18.32,0:07:19.17,Default,,0,0,0,,No—
Dialogue: 5,0:07:20.17,0:07:21.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Madoka, are you awake?
Dialogue: 5,0:07:21.88,0:07:24.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, what's wrong?
Dialogue: 5,0:07:29.18,0:07:30.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Again?
Dialogue: 5,0:07:30.44,0:07:31.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Jeez...
Dialogue: 5,0:07:33.38,0:07:35.19,Default,,0,0,0,,W-Water...
Dialogue: 5,0:07:39.26,0:07:41.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn you, baldy!
Dialogue: 5,0:07:41.61,0:07:44.80,Default,,0,0,0,,If you want to drink,\N drink by your damn self!
Dialogue: 5,0:07:44.80,0:07:46.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't make me pull that toupée off!
Dialogue: 5,0:07:46.75,0:07:47.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 5,0:07:47.86,0:07:49.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Should I make some hot chocolate?
Dialogue: 5,0:07:49.73,0:07:51.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, sure.
Dialogue: 5,0:07:52.85,0:07:55.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder why Mom loves her job so much.
Dialogue: 5,0:07:56.45,0:08:01.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Working at that company \Nwasn't exactly her dream, was it?
Dialogue: 5,0:08:01.34,0:08:06.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Hm... it's not that she loves her job as much as she loves a challenge.
Dialogue: 5,0:08:06.70,0:08:07.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 5,0:08:07.30,0:08:10.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure there are tough\N and painful times for her,
Dialogue: 5,0:08:10.96,0:08:16.56,Default,,0,0,0,,but the subsequent feeling of \Naccomplishment is her greatest joy.
Dialogue: 5,0:08:18.82,0:08:23.08,Default,,0,0,0,,She might not have wished to work where she does now,
Dialogue: 5,0:08:23.08,0:08:26.83,Default,,0,0,0,,but she's still living her ideal way of life.
Dialogue: 5,0:08:26.83,0:08:29.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Some dreams can come true like that.
Dialogue: 5,0:08:30.70,0:08:33.08,Default,,0,0,0,,So someone's dream can be their way of life?
Dialogue: 5,0:08:33.74,0:08:40.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure opinions differ, but I \Nreally like that about your mom.
Dialogue: 5,0:08:40.27,0:08:42.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I can respect that, and I take pride in it.
Dialogue: 5,0:08:42.34,0:08:44.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you think she's wonderful too?
Dialogue: 5,0:08:45.53,0:08:46.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 5,0:08:58.86,0:09:04.49,Default,,0,0,0,,You know you're putting innocent civilians in danger, don't you?
Dialogue: 5,0:09:05.74,0:09:08.60,Default,,0,0,0,,They've been chosen by Kyubey.
Dialogue: 5,0:09:08.60,0:09:10.32,Default,,0,0,0,,They're no longer "innocent civilians."
Dialogue: 5,0:09:11.24,0:09:14.15,Default,,0,0,0,,You're leading them toward\N becoming magical girls.
Dialogue: 5,0:09:14.79,0:09:17.01,Default,,0,0,0,,And I take it you don't like that?
Dialogue: 5,0:09:17.01,0:09:17.61,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 5,0:09:17.61,0:09:18.75,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a nuisance.
Dialogue: 5,0:09:19.31,0:09:21.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Especially in the case of Kaname Madoka.
Dialogue: 5,0:09:23.25,0:09:24.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 5,0:09:24.07,0:09:28.01,Default,,0,0,0,,So you've noticed her potential as well.
Dialogue: 5,0:09:28.01,0:09:31.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I cannot, under any circumstances, \Nallow her to make a contract.
Dialogue: 5,0:09:31.26,0:09:34.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it because you're afraid that anyone stronger will get in your way?
Dialogue: 5,0:09:34.68,0:09:36.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Sounds like paranoia to me.
Dialogue: 5,0:09:40.06,0:09:42.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I have no reason to fight you, but...
Dialogue: 5,0:09:43.43,0:09:46.54,Default,,0,0,0,,In that case, make sure we never meet again.
Dialogue: 5,0:09:46.54,0:09:51.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure tonight's the last time we'll resolve this peacefully.
Dialogue: 5,0:10:03.46,0:10:05.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, sorry for the wait.
Dialogue: 5,0:10:05.40,0:10:08.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? You couldn't see Kamijou{*}-kun{*}?
Dialogue: 5,0:10:08.64,0:10:11.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess it's not a good day for him.
Dialogue: 5,0:10:11.47,0:10:13.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Seriously, I came all this way too.
Dialogue: 5,0:10:13.53,0:10:15.20,Default,,0,0,0,,It's pretty rude.
Dialogue: 5,0:10:19.53,0:10:20.80,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 5,0:10:20.80,0:10:22.98,Default,,0,0,0,,There's something over there...
Dialogue: 5,0:10:25.36,0:10:26.86,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a Grief Seed!
Dialogue: 5,0:10:26.86,0:10:28.29,Default,,0,0,0,,It's about to hatch!
Dialogue: 5,0:10:28.74,0:10:29.72,Default,,0,0,0,,No way.
Dialogue: 5,0:10:29.72,0:10:31.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is it here?
Dialogue: 5,0:10:31.09,0:10:33.24,Default,,0,0,0,,This is bad. We've gotta get out of here!
Dialogue: 5,0:10:33.24,0:10:35.65,Default,,0,0,0,,The barrier will go up soon.
Dialogue: 5,0:10:36.30,0:10:37.86,Default,,0,0,0,,That maze thing again?
Dialogue: 5,0:10:39.50,0:10:42.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Madoka, do you know Mami{*}-san{*}'s cell number?
Dialogue: 5,0:10:42.92,0:10:43.95,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 5,0:10:43.95,0:10:45.38,Default,,0,0,0,,This isn't good...
Dialogue: 5,0:10:45.38,0:10:48.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Madoka, go and get Mami{*}-san{*}.
Dialogue: 5,0:10:48.76,0:10:50.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll watch over the seed.
Dialogue: 5,0:10:50.38,0:10:51.65,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't!
Dialogue: 5,0:10:51.65,0:10:52.74,Default,,0,0,0,,It's too dangerous!
Dialogue: 5,0:10:52.74,0:10:55.91,Default,,0,0,0,,We still have time until the witch hatches,
Dialogue: 5,0:10:55.91,0:10:59.06,Default,,0,0,0,,but you'll be stuck once the barrier goes up.
Dialogue: 5,0:10:59.06,0:11:01.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know if Mami will\N make it here in time...
Dialogue: 5,0:11:01.62,0:11:05.77,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't find the witch\N once the maze goes up, right?
Dialogue: 5,0:11:07.84,0:11:11.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't let it hatch in a place like this.
Dialogue: 5,0:11:14.03,0:11:16.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Madoka, go find her.
Dialogue: 5,0:11:16.40,0:11:18.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll stay with Sayaka.
Dialogue: 5,0:11:19.20,0:11:23.03,Default,,0,0,0,,When Mami gets here, she'll \Nknow my location via telepathy.
Dialogue: 5,0:11:23.03,0:11:26.09,Default,,0,0,0,,If I watch over the Grief Seed with Sayaka,
Dialogue: 5,0:11:26.09,0:11:30.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be able to guide Mami to the \Nshortest route out of the barrier.
Dialogue: 5,0:11:30.01,0:11:32.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Kyubey.
Dialogue: 5,0:11:32.67,0:11:35.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll... I'll get Mami{*}-san{*} here as fast as I can.
Dialogue: 5,0:11:59.99,0:12:01.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you scared, Sayaka?
Dialogue: 5,0:12:01.62,0:12:02.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, yeah.
Dialogue: 5,0:12:02.91,0:12:04.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course I am.
Dialogue: 5,0:12:04.53,0:12:10.84,Default,,0,0,0,,If you can come up with a wish, I can \Nturn you into a magical girl right here.
Dialogue: 5,0:12:11.49,0:12:12.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 5,0:12:12.84,0:12:14.89,Default,,0,0,0,,If things get bad enough,\N I might ask you for that.
Dialogue: 5,0:12:15.82,0:12:17.77,Default,,0,0,0,,But for now, I'll wait.
Dialogue: 5,0:12:17.77,0:12:20.35,Default,,0,0,0,,This is important to me.
Dialogue: 5,0:12:21.18,0:12:24.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd rather not decide until I'm really ready.
Dialogue: 5,0:12:30.73,0:12:31.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Here, right?
Dialogue: 5,0:12:38.62,0:12:40.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Kyubey, what's the status?
Dialogue: 5,0:12:40.68,0:12:42.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}We're good for now.
Dialogue: 5,0:12:42.16,0:12:44.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}There are no signs of it hatching yet.
Dialogue: 5,0:12:44.52,0:12:46.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Sayaka{*}-chan{*}, are you okay?
Dialogue: 5,0:12:46.28,0:12:47.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Of course.
Dialogue: 5,0:12:47.64,0:12:49.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm about to fall asleep from boredom.
Dialogue: 5,0:12:49.13,0:12:53.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's actually worse to \Nprovoke the egg using magic.
Dialogue: 5,0:12:53.89,0:12:55.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You don't have to hurry,
Dialogue: 5,0:12:55.38,0:12:57.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}so could you come as calmly as possible?
Dialogue: 5,0:12:57.37,0:12:58.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Got it.
Dialogue: 5,0:13:11.73,0:13:13.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm glad we made it in time.
Dialogue: 5,0:13:13.76,0:13:17.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I would've been mad at you\N guys for being too reckless,
Dialogue: 5,0:13:17.71,0:13:20.19,Default,,0,0,0,,but you made the right decision this time.
Dialogue: 5,0:13:20.72,0:13:23.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Now we don't have to worry\N about the witch getting—
Dialogue: 5,0:13:25.12,0:13:28.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought I said I didn't\N want to see you again.
Dialogue: 5,0:13:28.58,0:13:31.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll take down the prey this time.
Dialogue: 5,0:13:31.06,0:13:32.84,Default,,0,0,0,,You two should leave.
Dialogue: 5,0:13:32.84,0:13:34.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think so.
Dialogue: 5,0:13:34.80,0:13:37.38,Default,,0,0,0,,We need to get Miki{*}-san{*} and Kyubey.
Dialogue: 5,0:13:37.38,0:13:39.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I can guarantee their safety.
Dialogue: 5,0:13:39.84,0:13:41.80,Default,,0,0,0,,You think I'd trust you?
Dialogue: 5,0:13:47.35,0:13:51.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I-Idiot... Now's not the time for this.
Dialogue: 5,0:13:51.27,0:13:54.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want to hurt you,
Dialogue: 5,0:13:54.23,0:13:56.78,Default,,0,0,0,,but I can't guarantee your \Nsafety if you struggle too much.
Dialogue: 5,0:13:56.78,0:14:00.54,Default,,0,0,0,,This witch is nothing like the ones you've encountered so far.
Dialogue: 5,0:14:00.54,0:14:03.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Be a good girl and I'll let\Nyou out on the way back.
Dialogue: 5,0:14:04.94,0:14:07.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go, Kaname{*}-san{*}.
Dialogue: 5,0:14:07.13,0:14:08.29,Default,,0,0,0,,O-Okay.
Dialogue: 5,0:14:09.18,0:14:10.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Wai—
Dialogue: 5,0:14:37.82,0:14:40.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Um... Mami{*}-san{*}.
Dialogue: 5,0:14:40.36,0:14:41.54,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 5,0:14:41.54,0:14:46.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought about my wish a lot, and...
Dialogue: 5,0:14:46.07,0:14:47.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you make up your mind?
Dialogue: 5,0:14:47.49,0:14:55.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, but I think you might get \Nmad at me for being too naïve.
Dialogue: 5,0:14:55.04,0:14:57.36,Default,,0,0,0,,What's your wish?
Dialogue: 5,0:14:57.36,0:15:03.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I've never had a subject I was good at or any skill that I could be proud of.
Dialogue: 5,0:15:04.89,0:15:09.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought I'd spend the rest of my life without being able to help anyone,
Dialogue: 5,0:15:09.00,0:15:10.98,Default,,0,0,0,,and that I'd always be a burden.
Dialogue: 5,0:15:12.06,0:15:14.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I couldn't stand it.
Dialogue: 5,0:15:18.90,0:15:24.74,Default,,0,0,0,,But then I met you, and you showed me \Nwhat it was like to fight to save people.
Dialogue: 5,0:15:26.12,0:15:30.38,Default,,0,0,0,,You told me I might be capable of doing the same thing.
Dialogue: 5,0:15:31.36,0:15:34.00,Default,,0,0,0,,It made me happier than anything...
Dialogue: 5,0:15:35.25,0:15:41.54,Default,,0,0,0,,So my wish will be granted\N if I become a magical girl.
Dialogue: 5,0:15:42.61,0:15:50.39,Default,,0,0,0,,There's nothing I wish more than to have the power to help people.
Dialogue: 5,0:15:51.60,0:15:53.14,Default,,0,0,0,,It's hard, you know.
Dialogue: 5,0:15:53.14,0:15:54.82,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll get hurt,
Dialogue: 5,0:15:54.82,0:15:57.90,Default,,0,0,0,,and you won't have time to fall in love or hang out with friends.
Dialogue: 5,0:15:57.90,0:16:03.44,Default,,0,0,0,,But I still want to become someone who never gives up, just like you.
Dialogue: 5,0:16:04.91,0:16:08.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobody should become someone like me.
Dialogue: 5,0:16:09.79,0:16:12.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm just acting cool,
Dialogue: 5,0:16:12.13,0:16:15.70,Default,,0,0,0,,but I have no one to talk \Nwith when I'm scared or sad...
Dialogue: 5,0:16:15.70,0:16:17.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm forced to cry all alone.
Dialogue: 5,0:16:18.62,0:16:22.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Being a magical girl really isn't that great.
Dialogue: 5,0:16:23.87,0:16:26.96,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not alone anymore, Mami{*}-san{*}.
Dialogue: 5,0:16:28.38,0:16:31.39,Default,,0,0,0,,You're right.. You really are...
Dialogue: 5,0:16:36.23,0:16:40.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Will you really fight with me from now on?
Dialogue: 5,0:16:41.50,0:16:43.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Will you stay by my side?
Dialogue: 5,0:16:43.40,0:16:46.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, if you're really okay\N with someone like me.
Dialogue: 5,0:16:46.91,0:16:48.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Gosh...
Dialogue: 5,0:16:49.23,0:16:52.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Some role model I turned out to be.
Dialogue: 5,0:16:53.04,0:16:55.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess I'm really not that great after all.
Dialogue: 5,0:16:55.16,0:16:56.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Mami{*}-san{*}...
Dialogue: 5,0:16:57.30,0:17:02.08,Default,,0,0,0,,But since you have the chance, \Nyou should come up with a wish.
Dialogue: 5,0:17:02.08,0:17:05.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess you have a point there.
Dialogue: 5,0:17:05.17,0:17:10.02,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a contract, so you might as well get something out of it.
Dialogue: 5,0:17:10.02,0:17:12.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Make yourself a billionaire, \Nor get yourself a wonderful boyfriend.
Dialogue: 5,0:17:12.90,0:17:14.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Anything goes!
Dialogue: 5,0:17:14.54,0:17:16.19,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not really...
Dialogue: 5,0:17:16.19,0:17:18.17,Default,,0,0,0,,How about this, then?
Dialogue: 5,0:17:18.17,0:17:22.08,Default,,0,0,0,,If you haven't thought of a wish by \Nthe time we've taken out this witch,
Dialogue: 5,0:17:22.08,0:17:25.58,Default,,0,0,0,,how about you wish for a grand feast and a cake from Kyubey?
Dialogue: 5,0:17:25.58,0:17:27.20,Default,,0,0,0,,A-A cake?
Dialogue: 5,0:17:27.20,0:17:31.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah—the largest, most extravagant party cake you've ever seen!
Dialogue: 5,0:17:32.25,0:17:34.93,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll have a party with everyone
Dialogue: 5,0:17:34.93,0:17:38.87,Default,,0,0,0,,to celebrate us joining together\N as a magical girl team.
Dialogue: 5,0:17:38.87,0:17:41.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to become a\N magical girl for cake?
Dialogue: 5,0:17:41.63,0:17:44.04,Default,,0,0,0,,If you don't like it, come up\N with something yourself!
Dialogue: 5,0:17:45.76,0:17:46.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Mami.
Dialogue: 5,0:17:48.23,0:17:50.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The Grief Seed has begun to move.
Dialogue: 5,0:17:50.59,0:17:51.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's hatching.
Dialogue: 5,0:17:51.93,0:17:53.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Hurry!
Dialogue: 5,0:17:53.18,0:17:55.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay. Got it.
Dialogue: 5,0:17:55.33,0:17:58.05,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a special occasion, \Nso I'll take care of this one fast.
Dialogue: 5,0:17:58.82,0:17:59.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 5,0:18:33.16,0:18:34.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I feel light.
Dialogue: 5,0:18:35.65,0:18:38.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I've never fought with such\N a happy feeling before.
Dialogue: 5,0:18:41.56,0:18:43.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm not scared of anything anymore.
Dialogue: 5,0:18:48.41,0:18:50.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm no longer alone!
Dialogue: 5,0:18:59.45,0:19:00.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry for the wait.
Dialogue: 5,0:19:00.97,0:19:02.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You're just in time.
Dialogue: 5,0:19:03.25,0:19:04.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch out.
Dialogue: 5,0:19:04.51,0:19:05.84,Default,,0,0,0,,It's coming!
Dialogue: 5,0:19:17.41,0:19:20.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry to ruin the fun,\N but I'm ending this now.
Dialogue: 5,0:19:22.60,0:19:23.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Here I go!
Dialogue: 5,0:19:32.41,0:19:33.66,Default,,0,0,0,,She did it!
Dialogue: 5,0:19:38.16,0:19:41.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Tiro Finale!{\i0}
Dialogue: 5,0:20:01.18,0:20:02.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me...
Dialogue: 5,0:20:08.82,0:20:12.07,Default,,0,0,0,,You two, hurry and make\N a contract with me!
Dialogue: 5,0:20:12.07,0:20:13.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Madoka!
Dialogue: 5,0:20:13.21,0:20:14.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Sayaka!
Dialogue: 5,0:20:17.57,0:20:19.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Decide on your wishes!
Dialogue: 5,0:20:19.54,0:20:20.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry!
Dialogue: 5,0:20:20.43,0:20:22.37,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not necessary.
Dialogue: 5,0:20:26.58,0:20:29.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll take care of it.
Dialogue: 5,0:21:19.98,0:21:22.81,Default,,0,0,0,,A moment later and you\N would have been dead.
Dialogue: 5,0:21:29.67,0:21:31.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Burn this moment into your eyes.
Dialogue: 5,0:21:31.73,0:21:34.78,Default,,0,0,0,,This is what it means to\N become a magical girl.
Dialogue: 5,0:21:51.80,0:21:53.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Give that back.
Dialogue: 5,0:21:55.45,0:21:56.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Give that back.
Dialogue: 5,0:21:56.68,0:22:01.39,Default,,0,0,0,,That... That... belongs to Mami{*}-san{*}!
Dialogue: 5,0:22:01.88,0:22:04.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I said give that back to Mami{*}-san{*}!
Dialogue: 5,0:22:05.24,0:22:08.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Right. These are for magical girls.
Dialogue: 5,0:22:08.58,0:22:11.63,Default,,0,0,0,,You two have no right to touch one.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.07,0:22:26.12,Default,chptr,0,0,0,,{ED}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.04,0:23:56.08,Default,chptr,0,0,0,,{Preview}
Dialogue: 5,0:23:56.82,0:24:00.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an1}Mami{*}-san{*} was really kind.
Dialogue: 5,0:24:00.25,0:24:07.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an1}To show us what it \Ntakes to fight, she...
Dialogue: 5,0:24:08.03,0:24:10.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an1}Miracles and magic do exist.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.94,0:02:05.72,Opening-Connect-English,,0,0,0,,{\blur3.5\fad(150,480)}I'll walk upon this Earth,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.72,0:02:07.79,Opening-Connect-English,,0,0,0,,{\blur3.5}and pierce this shadowy veil of unease,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.79,0:02:11.40,Opening-Connect-English,,0,0,0,,{\blur3.5\fad(0,580)}as many times as necessary
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.55,0:02:32.85,Opening-Connect-English,,0,0,0,,{\blur3.5\fad(0,580)}with these unwavering feelings
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.70,0:02:48.53,Opening-Connect-English,,0,0,0,,{\blur3.5}the beautiful blue sky will always be waiting for me
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.29,0:01:30.71,Opening-Connect-English-blue,,0,0,0,,{\blur3.5\fad(200,0)}I'll never forget the promises we exchanged
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.71,0:01:33.17,Opening-Connect-English-blue,,0,0,0,,{\blur3.5}I still see it when I close my eyes
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.17,0:01:34.87,Opening-Connect-English-blue,,0,0,0,,{\blur3.5}I'll move forward as I cast off
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.87,0:01:38.67,Opening-Connect-English-blue,,0,0,0,,{\blur3.5\fad(0,580)}this darkness engulfing me
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.95,0:01:54.78,Opening-Connect-English-dreams,,0,0,0,,{\blur3.5\fad(200,480)}How long will it be before
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.78,0:02:00.94,Opening-Connect-English-dreams,,0,0,0,,{\blur3.5\fad(0,480)}I see that lost future again?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.53,0:02:50.83,Opening-Connect-English-night,,0,0,0,,{\blur3.5}So I won't be afraid
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.83,0:02:56.96,Opening-Connect-English-night,,0,0,0,,{\blur3.5\fad(0,1020)}No matter what happens next, I won't give in
